stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Cold
  Cold --> Observing: fresh scope / valid checkpoint
  Observing --> Observing: duplicate / proved metadata skip
  Observing --> Building: relevant authoritative event
  Building --> Observing: gap or incomplete input / record and rebase
  Building --> Analyzing: complete bounded packet
  Analyzing --> Observing: rejected, abstained, timed out or clarify
  Analyzing --> Draft: validated hypotheses and current revision
  Draft --> Observing: shadow receipt / revoke / stale / expire
  Draft --> Review: separately approved review path
  Review --> Observing: explicit Host confirms with CAS or rejects
  Observing --> Cold: session closes / epoch changes
  Building --> Cold: scope revoked
  Analyzing --> Cold: scope revoked
  Draft --> Cold: scope revoked
  Review --> Cold: scope revoked
